#: scenario4:scenario4_DC2A8067_BE03_4F93_BCA8_AA4BB14E7DB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84ff28a04b0f7f6bbd7be00aa115d923bab1fb40557cb0b5f7f4d54cae52922d
